# Command Center™ (Platform Build Spec #007)

Internal-only ops hub — admin/ops roles, **never player-facing**.

## Rules

- **Orchestrate, don't duplicate** — read from PaymentEngine, `platform_audit_log`, existing DB tables
- Route admin data through `CommandCenterEngine` — not direct Supabase in UI routes
- Gate all API routes with `getAuthorizedAdminUser()` + `requireCommandCenterAdmin(section)`
- Activity feed aggregates existing sources — no duplicate event persistence
- Payment data via Transaction Center (`payment_transactions`) only

## Adding a section

1. Add nav item + role gate in `config.ts`
2. Add adapter/service if new data source needed
3. Expose via `CommandCenterEngine` + API route
4. Create page under `app/admin/command-center/`

## Roles

```env
COMMAND_CENTER_ROLE_MAP={"ops@example.com":"operations"}
```

Default role: `operations` (full access).

Full spec: `docs/project-legacy/COMMAND_CENTER.md`
